<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar production levies to be discussed.</title>
<headline>EU sugar production levies to be discussed.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union 1996-97 sugar production levies are due to be discussed by the sugar management committee on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;A routine discussion on production levies is listed for the meeting,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
